  "name": "05 WhatsApp Business API auto-reply + routing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 WhatsApp Business API automation (Meta Cloud API)\nMeta App → WhatsApp → Configuration → Callback URL `https://YOUR-N8N/webhook/whatsapp`, verify token = Config.verify_token, subscribe to **messages**.\n\nGET = Meta's one-time verification. POST = inbound messages.\nReplies are free-form text — allowed only within 24 h of the customer's last message (customer-service window).\n'other' intents are forwarded to the owner's WhatsApp.\n\nUsing Interakt/Gupshup instead? Point their webhook here and swap the HTTP nodes for their send-message API.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 500
      },
